SUMMARY:Jules Daud | Psycho Pat | Subskin Cables
LOCATION:Berlin\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:Jules Daud -- Originally from Argentina and based in New York C
 
ity\, Jules Daud blends the raw energy of punk with the soul of blues and t
 
he rhythms of Latin rock. His Spanish-language songs combine gritty guitars
 
\, powerful melodies\, and a distinctive rock & roll sound. Psycho Patt -- 
 
Blending garage rock and dark wave\, Psycho Patt brings a raw\, atmospheric
 
 sound driven by candid songwriting\, dark textures\, and underground rock 
 
influences. Subskin Cables -- Originally formed in Boston and now based in 
 
NYC\, Subskin Cables blend punk\, post-punk\, garage rock\, and psychedelia
 
. Their sound combines exploratory guitars\, poetic vocals\, hypnotic melod
 
ies\, and powerful rhythms. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event
 
